# HOTL workspace artifacts
hotl-workflow*.md
# Ignore contents of docs/plans/ (downstream user plans) but track plugin-owned
# slice plans so this repo can dogfood the initiative-support taxonomy.
# Note: use file-level patterns, not `docs/plans/`, so the `!` carve-out works —
# git cannot un-ignore files inside an ignored directory.
docs/plans/*
!docs/plans/*-slice-*-plan.md
docs/research/
docs/submissions/
.hotl/
.agents/
CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md

# IDEs
.idea/
.vscode/

# Vim
*.swp
*.swo

# Logs
*.log
